# Rechnungs- & Abrechnungsarchitektur (verbindlich)

Vollständige Architektur: **`docs/onroda-invoice-billing-architecture.md`**.

## Kurz

- **Tabellen:** `invoices` + `invoice_items` (Migration **028**) — **nicht** `onroda_invoices`.
- **Partner-API:** `GET /panel/v1/invoices`, `…/:id`, `…/:id/pdf` in `routes/panelInvoiceRoutes.ts`; Daten `db/panelInvoicesData.ts`; PDF `lib/invoicePdfServer.ts`.
